'''Hiroshi Ikeda''' (池田 裕|Ikeda Hiroshi; born January 8, 1950) is a Japanese aikido teacher based in the [[Boulder, CO]]. He holds the rank of 8th ''[[dan rank|dan]]'' (''[[shihan]]'') from the [[Aikikai]].<ref name="Pranin-Encyclopedia">{{cite encyclopedia
 |last=Pranin
 |first=Stanley
 |title=Ikeda, Hiroshi
 |encyclopedia=Encyclopedia of Aikido
 |publisher=Aikido Journal
 |date=2007
 |url=http://www.aikidojournal.com/encyclopedia?entryID=811
 |access-date=2007-11-14
 |url-status=dead
 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20110605115217/http://www.aikidojournal.com/encyclopedia?entryID=811
 |archive-date=2011-06-05
}}</ref> He is a senior student of [[Mitsugi Saotome]] and is affiliated with the [[Aikido Schools of Ueshiba]] (ASU).

Ikeda was born in [[Tokyo]] and began studying aikido in 1968 while attending [[Kokugakuin University]]. He relocated to [[Sarasota, Florida]], in 1976 and taught there under Saotome from 1978 to 1979.

In 1980, Ikeda moved to [[Boulder, Colorado]], where he established [[https://www.boulderaikikai.org/]] under Saotome's ASU organization.<ref name="Pranin-Encyclopedia"/> Boulder Aikikai describes itself as having been established by Ikeda in 1980 and as being affiliated with the Aikido World Headquarters in Tokyo through the Aikido Shimbokukai.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=About Boulder Aikikai
 |website=Boulder Aikikai
 |url=https://www.boulderaikikai.org/
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>

Ikeda continues to teach at Boulder Aikikai and travels internationally to conduct aikido seminars. Boulder Aikikai publishes a schedule of his seminars and special teaching engagements.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=Hiroshi Ikeda Seminars
 |website=Boulder Aikikai
 |url=https://www.boulderaikikai.org/hiroshi-ikeda-seminars
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>

== Scheduled seminars ==

As of 17 September 2026, Ikeda's official seminar schedule lists the following upcoming engagements:

* '''18–20 September 2026''': Bond Street Dojo, [[New York City]], United States.
* '''13–15 November 2026''': Shindai Aikido, [[Orlando, Florida]], United States.
* '''18–20 December 2026''': Arizona Aikido, [[Phoenix, Arizona]], United States.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=Hiroshi Ikeda Seminars
 |website=Boulder Aikikai
 |url=https://www.boulderaikikai.org/hiroshi-ikeda-seminars
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>

== Historical Seminars and public demonstrations ==

* In April 1982, Ikeda, then a fifth-degree black belt, taught an aikido seminar at the [[University of Montana]], followed by a public demonstration.<ref>{{cite news
 |title=Martial art seminar, demonstration offered
 |newspaper=[[The Missoulian]]
 |date=1982-04-13
 |page=11
 |url=https://www.newspapers.com/image/349991222/
}}</ref>
* In September and October 1991, he taught a three-day seminar for the Sarasota/New College AikiKai at [[New College of Florida]] in [[Sarasota, Florida]], where he had founded his first American dojo.<ref>{{cite news
 |title=Aikido seminar listing
 |newspaper=[[The Bradenton Herald]]
 |date=1991-09-29
 |page=22
 |url=https://www.newspapers.com/image/719083882/
}}</ref>
* In October 2000, Ikeda led a seminar at the Sanders Beach Recreation Center in [[Pensacola, Florida]].<ref>{{cite news
 |title=Martial arts focus of seminar
 |newspaper=[[Pensacola News Journal]]
 |date=2000-09-30
 |page=34
 |url=https://www.newspapers.com/image/268725982/
}}</ref>
* In March 2011, Ikeda taught a three-day seminar at Aikido of Tamalpais in Corte Madera, California.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=Hiroshi Ikeda Shihan at Aikido of Tamalpais
 |website=AikiWeb
 |date=2011-01-27
 |url=http://www.aikiweb.com/forums/showthread.php?t=19327
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>
* In August 2014, he returned to Aikido of Tamalpais for a seminar held from August 7 to 10.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=Hiroshi Ikeda Shihan at Aikido of Tamalpais
 |website=Aikido Schools of Ueshiba
 |date=2014-08-07
 |url=https://asu.org/seminar/hiroshi-ikeda-shihan-at-aikido-of-tamalpais-2/
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>
* In May 2023, Ikeda taught at an Aikido Summer Seminar hosted by Aikido Kenkyukai in [[Los Angeles]] at Aikido Kenkyukai 2936 West 8th Street, Los Angeles.<ref>{{cite web
 |title=Aikido Summer Seminar
 |website=California Aikido Association
 |date=2023-05-26
 |url=https://ai-ki-do.org/events/2023/5/26/aikido-summer-seminar
 |access-date=2026-09-17
}}</ref>
* Aikido of Tamalpais advertised further Ikeda seminars in January 2023 and January 2025.<ref>{{cite web
